182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (Overall, the data shows that tributes in the 10th Hunger Games were influenced by several things, including kills, alliances, and pre-game bets. The books and films maintained pretty consistent rankings and death orders, but some individual tributes experienced huge changes. A big thing we noticed was that higher kill counts did not necessarily guarantee victory, and Lucy Gray's win showed that pre-game favorites do not always determine the outcome. Ultimately, these highlight how different variables contribute to survival and success in the Hunger Games.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
